  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1: Scattered mainly light rain showers remain \npossible across the east overnight, as low pressure moves \nslowly along the southern New England coast.\n\nA few rain showers remain possible across eastern Pennsylvania \novernight, with clearing skies farther to the west. Expect more \nof the same for Thursday, with considerable cloudiness and \nscattered rain showers across eastern Pennsylvania and partly \nsunny skies across the west. Temperatures will be seasonable \novernight into Thursday.\n \nExpect drier conditions for Friday and Saturday. Chances for \nshowers and thunderstorms increase Saturday night into Sunday \nahead of an approaching shortwave, but there are still timing \ndifferences regarding this feature.",
